  <div class="content-page__inner">
    <h1 class="content-page__title">Contact</h1>
    <p class="content-page__intro">Have questions, feedback, or want to contribute? We would love to hear from you.</p>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Report a Bug or Issue</h2>
      <p>Found a problem with a lesson, word, or sound? Open an issue on our GitHub repository. Please include the lesson number and a description of the issue.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Contribute</h2>
      <p>Open Phonics is open source and welcomes contributions. Areas where help is needed:</p>
      <ul class="guide-tips">
        <li>Lesson content review for pedagogical accuracy</li>
        <li>Additional stories for each phase</li>
        <li>Translations and localization</li>
        <li>Accessibility testing</li>
        <li>Design and UX improvements</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">General Inquiries</h2>
      <p>For general questions about Open Phonics, reach out to the team at <a href="https://www.pikespeakwebdesigns.com">Pikes Peak Web Designs</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Support</h2>
      <p>For help using the program, see our <a href="/support/">Support page</a> with FAQ and troubleshooting.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
